  "desc": "This is a simple example of measuring voltage with a digital multimeter (DMM) using an Arduino. The DMM is connected in parallel to measure the voltage across an LED. The circuit includes a 5V power source, a resistor, a DMM, an LED, and a ground connection. The code reads the voltage value from the DMM and prints it to the Serial Monitor.",
